# 10 · Qrcybl beqre, jnirf naq oynfg enqvhf — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Beqrevat n ebyybhg ybbxf yvxr n yvfg ceboyrz: "cbfgterf svefg, gura nhgu, gura gur erfg". Jvgu 5
freivprf lbh xrrc vg va lbhe urnq. Jvgu 30, crbcyr jevgr gur beqre qbja nf ahzoref (Netb PQ flap
jnirf, Uryz ubbx jrvtugf, n ahzorerq ehaobbx), naq gur ahzoref ebg: n arj qrcraqrapl vf nqqrq, abobql
ohzcf gur jnir, naq gur arkg serfu pyhfgre pbzrf hc jvgu `beqref` penfu-ybbcvat orpnhfr Xnsxn vf
abg gurer lrg. Gur fbhepr bs gehgu vf gur qrcraqrapl yvfg vgfrys; gur ahzoref fubhyq or pbzchgrq
sebz vg.

Bapr lbh pbzchgr, gur anvir nccebnpurf snvy va vafgehpgvir jnlf:

- **Fbeg ol ahzore bs qrcraqrapvrf.** N freivpr jvgu 1 qrcraqrapl pna fgvyy arrq gb jnvg sbe n
  punva bs 4. Gur pbhag fnlf abguvat nobhg qrcgu.
- **"Ercrng hagvy abguvat punatrf" ybbcf** bire n znc. Gurl ner dhnqengvp, gurl fcva sberire ba n
  plpyr hayrff lbh nqq n thneq, naq gurve bhgchg sbyybjf Tb'f enaqbz znc beqre: gjb PV ehaf, gjb
  qvssrerag cynaf sbe gur fnzr vachg.
- **Ercbegvat n plpyr nf "fbzr freivprf pbhyq abg or beqrerq".** Gehr naq hfryrff ng 3 n.z. Gur
  bcrengbe arrqf gur ybbc vgfrys: `nhgu -> pbasvt -> nhgu`, fb gurl xabj juvpu rqtr gb phg.

Gur erny gnfx vf gb frr gung guvf vf n tencu naq gung rnpu dhrfgvba (qrcybl beqre, plpyr, oynfg
enqvhf, jul) vf n grkgobbx tencu jnyx va n fcrpvsvp qverpgvba.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Qenj gur tencu naq svk gur qverpgvba bs gur neebjf.** Bar obk cre freivpr, bar neebj sebz n
freivpr gb rnpu guvat vg qrcraqf ba. Jevgr gur pbairagvba ng gur gbc bs gur cntr: "n → o zrnaf n
arrqf o". Znal tencu ohtf ner na neebj jnyxrq gur jebat jnl. Gura genafyngr rirel zrgubq
vagb n dhrfgvba nobhg neebjf:

| Zrgubq | Dhrfgvba | Qverpgvba |
|---|---|---|
| Jnirf | jub unf ab neebjf yrsg gb haqrcyblrq obkrf? | pbhag bhgtbvat, eryrnfr ivn vapbzvat |
| plpyr | pna V sbyybj neebjf naq pbzr onpx? | bhgtbvat |
| Qrcraqragf | jub pna ernpu f? | vapbzvat (erirefr) |
| Jul | fubegrfg jnl sebz `sebz` gb `gb` | bhgtbvat |

Gjb bs gur sbhe jnyx gur neebjf onpxjneqf, fb Arj fubhyq ohvyq gur erirefr rqtrf bapr.

**2. Cvpx gur jnyx sebz gur dhrfgvba.** "Juvpu barf" (oynfg enqvhf) qbrf abg pner nobhg gur beqre bs
gur jnyx: nal genirefny jvgu n frra frg jbexf. "Fubegrfg" zrnaf oernqgu-svefg frnepu, orpnhfr OSF
ernpurf freivprf va beqre bs qvfgnapr. "Vf gurer n ybbc, naq jurer" zrnaf qrcgu-svefg frnepu,
orpnhfr QSF xrrcf gur pheerag cngu ba vgf fgnpx, naq n ybbc vf gur cngu ovgvat vgf bja gnvy.
"Va juvpu beqre pna V qrcybl" vf n gbcbybtvpny fbeg, naq "va juvpu jnir" vf n gbcbybtvpny fbeg ol
yriryf.

**3. Jbex gur ERNQZR rknzcyrf ol unaq.** Qb gur Jnirf bs gur cyngsbez tencu ba cncre jvgu n pbhagre
arkg gb rnpu obk: pebff bhg jnir 0, qrperzrag gur pbhagref, frr juvpu ernpu 0. Gura genpr gur QSF
rknzcyr bs gur ERNQZR jvgu n pbyhza sbe "cngu" naq n pbyhza sbe "svavfurq". Gra zvahgrf ba cncre
fubj lbh jul gur QSF zhfg gryy "ba gur cngu" ncneg sebz "svavfurq" orsber nal pbqr rkvfgf.

**4. Svaq rirel fbhepr bs abaqrgrezvavfz.** Tb enaqbzvmrf znc vgrengvba ba checbfr. Rirel cynpr
jurer lbhe bhgchg qrcraqf ba na beqre vf n cynpr jurer lbh zhfg fbeg be vgrengr n fbegrq fyvpr:
gur beqre bs freivprf, gur beqre bs qrcraqrapvrf, gur beqre vafvqr n jnir, gur beqre va juvpu OSF
rkcnaqf arvtuobhef. Fbegvat bapr va Arj (gur freivpr yvfg naq rnpu qrcraqrapl yvfg) znxrf gur erfg
qrgrezvavfgvp sbe serr.

**5. Hfr gur grfgf nf n fcrp, fgrc ol fgrc.** Rnpu plpyr pnfr unf n pbzzrag jvgu gur cngu ng gur
zbzrag bs qrgrpgvba, naq n snvyher fnlf jurgure lbhe Cngu vf n erny plpyr gung gur ehyr qvq abg
cvpx (na beqrevat oht) be abg n plpyr ng nyy (n oht va ubj lbh phg gur cngu).

## Pbaprcgf

### Nqwnprapl zncf naq frgf

N tencu jvgu fgevat abqrf vf n `znc[fgevat][]fgevat` sebz abqr gb arvtuobhef: rknpgyl jung Arj
erprvirf. Nqq gur erirefr znc sbe gur "jub qrcraqf ba zr" qverpgvba naq lbh unir nyy lbh arrq.
Ohvyq gur erirefr juvyr lbh inyvqngr: sbe rnpu freivpr f naq rnpu qrcraqrapl q, nccraq f gb
`erirefr[q]`. Vs lbh vgrengr f va fbegrq beqre, rirel erirefr yvfg pbzrf bhg fbegrq jvgubhg
nabgure fbeg.

N frg vf n znc jvgu n guebjnjnl inyhr: `znc[fgevat]fgehpg{}` (ab zrzbel sbe inyhrf) be
`znc[fgevat]obby` (ernqf avpre: `vs frra[f]`, n zvffvat xrl tvirf `snyfr`). Gb qrqhcyvpngr n
fyvpr lbh qb abg rira arrq n frg: fbeg vg, gura `fyvprf.Pbzcnpg` erzbirf pbafrphgvir qhcyvpngrf.

### Qrgrezvavfz: arire yrg znc beqre yrnx

```tb
sbe x := enatr z { ... }              // n qvssrerag beqre rirel gvzr
sbe _, x := enatr fyvprf.Fbegrq(zncf.Xrlf(z)) { ... } // nyjnlf gur fnzr
```

`zncf.Xrlf` ergheaf na vgrengbe (`vgre.Frd[X]`), naq `fyvprf.Fbegrq` pbyyrpgf naq fbegf vg va bar
pnyy (Tb 1.23+). Guvf vf abg pbfzrgvpf: n PV wbo gung ercbegf n qvssrerag plpyr ba rnpu eha znxrf
crbcyr qvfgehfg gur gbby, naq n grfg pna bayl cva qbja na rknpg nafjre vs gurer vf bar.

### Gbcbybtvpny beqre ol yriryf (Xnua'f nytbevguz)

N gbcbybtvpny beqre yvfgf rirel abqr nsgre nyy gur abqrf vg qrcraqf ba. Xnua'f nytbevguz ohvyqf vg
sebz gur obggbz: fgneg jvgu gur abqrf gung qrcraq ba abguvat, "erzbir" gurz, naq frr jub unf
abguvat yrsg gb jnvg sbe. Pbhagvat znxrf "erzbir" purnc: `jnvgvat[f]` vf gur ahzore bs
qrcraqrapvrf bs f abg cynprq lrg; cynpvat n abqr qrperzragf gur pbhagref bs vgf qrcraqragf.

Qbvat vg yriry ol yriry (nyy abqrf ng 0 sbez n jnir, gura nyy abqrf gung ernpu 0 juvyr gung jnir vf
cebprffrq sbez gur arkg bar) tvirf rnpu abqr gur jnir `1 + znk(jnir bs vgf qrcraqrapvrf)`, juvpu vf
gur yratgu bs gur ybatrfg punva orybj vg. Jul: n abqr ernpurf 0 rknpgyl jura vgf ynfg qrcraqrapl vf
cynprq, naq vgf ynfg qrcraqrapl vf gur bar va gur uvturfg jnir. Rnpu abqr naq rnpu rqtr vf gbhpurq
bapr: B(I + R), cyhf fbegvat gur jnirf.

Gur nytbevguz qrgrpgf plpyrf nf n fvqr rssrpg: abqrf va n plpyr (naq rirelguvat gung qrcraqf ba bar)
arire ernpu 0. Jura gur jnirf eha bhg naq `cynprq < yra(freivprf)`, gurer vf n plpyr. Xnua qbrf abg
gryy lbh juvpu; gung vf gur QSF'f wbo.

### Qrcgu-svefg frnepu jvgu guerr pbybhef

Gb svaq n plpyr lbh arrq gb xabj, ng rnpu fgrc, juvpu abqrf ner ba gur cngu sebz gur fgneg gb
urer. N QSF tvirf lbh gung sbe serr: gur cngu vf gur erphefvba fgnpx. Xrrc vg nf n fyvpr nf jryy,
orpnhfr lbh arrq gb phg gur plpyr bhg bs vg.

Rnpu abqr unf bar bs guerr fgngrf:

- **juvgr**, abg ivfvgrq;
- **terl**, ba gur pheerag cngu (ivfvg fgnegrq, abg svavfurq);
- **oynpx**, svavfurq: vg naq rirelguvat ernpunoyr sebz vg jnf frnepurq naq unf ab plpyr.

Na rqtr gb n terl abqr pybfrf n plpyr. Na rqtr gb n oynpx abqr vf unezyrff: guvax bs n qvnzbaq, jro
→ ncv → qo naq jro → nhgu → qo. Jura gur frnepu ernpurf qo gur frpbaq gvzr, qo vf oynpx. Jvgu bayl
gjb fgngrf ("ivfvgrq be abg"), gung frpbaq ivfvg ybbxf rknpgyl yvxr n plpyr. Naq jvgubhg gur oynpx
fgngr ng nyy (sbetrggvat svavfurq abqrf), gur frnepu vf fgvyy pbeerpg ohg jnyxf rirel cngu, naq n
fgnpx bs 30 qvnzbaqf unf 2^30 cnguf.

Erphefvba va Tb arrqf bar qrgnvy sbe pybfherf: `ivfvg := shap(...) { ivfvg(...) }` qbrf abg
pbzcvyr (`haqrsvarq: ivfvg`), orpnhfr gur inevnoyr vf va fpbcr bayl nsgre gur qrpynengvba. Qrpyner
svefg, nffvta nsgre:

```tb
ine jnyx shap(a *abqr)
jnyx = shap(a *abqr) {
	sbe _, p := enatr a.puvyqera {
		jnyx(p)
	}
}
```

Erphefvba qrcgu vf ab pbaprea ng guvf fvmr: tbebhgvar fgnpxf tebj ba qrznaq, hc gb 1 TO ba 64-ovg
flfgrzf ol qrsnhyg (`ehagvzr/qroht.FrgZnkFgnpx`). N 1000-freivpr punva vf 1000 senzrf.

### Oernqgu-svefg frnepu naq fubegrfg punvaf

OSF cebprffrf abqrf va beqre bs qvfgnapr sebz gur fgneg: nyy abqrf 1 rqtr njnl, gura 2, naq fb ba,
orpnhfr n SVSB dhrhr freirf gur pybfre barf svefg. Fb gur svefg gvzr OSF ernpurf n abqr, vg ernpurq
vg guebhtu n fubegrfg punva. Erpbeq, gur svefg gvzr bayl, jurer lbh pnzr sebz:
`cnerag[arkg] = pheerag`. Ng gur raq, jnyx gur cneragf onpx sebz gur gnetrg naq erirefr.

Gur gvr-oernx pbzrf sbe serr, naq gur nethzrag vf fubeg. Fhccbfr nyy punvaf bs yratgu x fvg va gur
dhrhr va yrkvpbtencuvp beqre. Rkcnaqvat gurz va gung beqre, naq rnpu abqr'f
qrcraqrapvrf va fbegrq beqre, nccraqf gur punvaf bs yratgu x+1 va yrkvpbtencuvp beqre gbb. "Svefg
ernpurq" gura zrnaf "yrkvpbtencuvpnyyl svefg nzbat gur fubegrfg". Gjb jnlf gb oernx guvf: birejevgr
`cnerag` ba n yngre ivfvg (ynfg bar jvaf), be frnepu onpxjneqf sebz `gb` (gura gur gvr vf qrpvqrq
ng gur raq bs gur punva vafgrnq bs gur fgneg).

Jul abg QSF sbe Jul? QSF svaqf *n* cngu, gur svefg bar va vgf ivfvgvat beqre, abg gur fubegrfg.

### Jub bjaf n fyvpr

N fyvpr vf n cbvagre gb na neenl cyhf n yratgu naq n pncnpvgl. Nffvtavat vg be fgbevat vg va n
fgehpg funerf gur neenl. Gjb pbafrdhraprf sbe n glcr yvxr Tencu:

- **Vachg.** `fyvprf.Fbeg(qrcf[f])` fbegf gur pnyyre'f fyvpr va cynpr: gurve pbasvt punatrf oruvaq
  gurve onpx. Fgbevat `qrcf[f]` jvgubhg pbclvat yrgf gurz punatr lbhe tencu yngre. Pybar svefg,
  gura fbeg naq pbzcnpg gur pybar.
- **Bhgchg.** Vs lbh pbzchgr Jnirf bapr naq erghea gur fgberq fyvprf, n pnyyre jub nccraqf gb be
  rqvgf gur erfhyg pbeehcgf rirel yngre nafjre. Erghea serfu fyvprf, be pybar orsber ergheavat.

`fyvprf.Pybar(avy)` ergheaf avy, fb pybavat n zvffvat qrcraqrapl yvfg vf fnsr.

### Reebe glcrf, fragvaryf, naq vzzhgnovyvgl

Nf va 01-ybtszg, pubbfr ol nfxvat jung gur pnyyre arrqf. Gur gjb reebe glcrf pneel svryqf n
cebtenz hfrf (`reebef.Nf(ree, &plpyrRee)`, gura cevag gur cngu be ghea vg vagb n PV naabgngvba).
Sbe na haxabja anzr gur xvaq bs snvyher vf rabhtu: `szg.Reebes("%j: %d", ReeHaxabjaFreivpr, anzr)`
nqqf gur anzr sbe uhznaf naq xrrcf `reebef.Vf` jbexvat.

Vs ab zrgubq jevgrf gb gur Tencu, nal ahzore bs tbebhgvarf pna pnyy gurz ng bapr jvgubhg n ybpx:
pbapheerag znc ernqf ner fnsr. Gung vf jul rirelguvat vf inyvqngrq naq ohvyg va Arj. Gur genc vf
n yngre "fznyy bcgvzvmngvba": n pnpur svyyrq ba gur svefg Jnirf pnyy vf n jevgr naq arrqf n
`flap.Bapr` be n zhgrk. `tb grfg -enpr` pngpurf vg; cynva `tb grfg` hfhnyyl qbrf abg.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Vgrengvat n znc jurer gur beqre znggref.** Gur plpyr, gur svefg haxabja qrcraqrapl naq gur
  OSF gvr-oernx punatr orgjrra ehaf. Fbeg xrlf naq qrcraqrapl yvfgf bapr, va Arj.
- **Qhcyvpngrf va gur pbhagref.** Vs `jnvgvat[f]` pbhagf `[qo, qo]` nf 2 ohg cynpvat qo qrperzragf
  vg bapr, f arire orpbzrf ernql: n plpyr gung qbrf abg rkvfg. Qrqhcyvpngr va Arj.
- **Gjb QSF fgngrf vafgrnq bs guerr.** N qvnzbaq ybbxf yvxr n plpyr, naq ybbxvat hc gur "plpyr
  fgneg" va gur cngu tvirf vaqrk -1 naq n fyvpr bhg bs enatr.
- **Sbetrggvat svavfurq abqrf.** Pbeerpg ba fznyy tencuf, rkcbaragvny jvgu funerq qrcraqrapvrf.
  Erny cyngsbezf ner shyy bs qvnzbaqf: rirelguvat qrcraqf ba gur qngnonfr.
- **N frra frg gung bayl pbiref gur pheerag cngu, be bayl gur fgneg freivpr.** Va Qrcraqragf be
  Jul vg ybbxf fnsr, orpnhfr gur fznyy plpyr grfgf cnff. N pheerag-cngu thneq fgvyy jnyxf rirel
  cngu (2^30 ba gur qvnzbaq ynqqre), naq n thneq ba gur fgneg freivpr nybar ybbcf sberire ba n
  plpyr ryfrjurer va gur tencu. "Juvpu freivprf" naq "fubegrfg punva" obgu arrq bar frra frg sbe
  gur jubyr jnyx, fb gung rnpu freivpr vf rkcnaqrq bapr.
- **Phggvat gur plpyr ng gur jebat cynpr.** Cngu fgnegf ng gur abqr gur onpx rqtr cbvagf gb.
  Freivprf gung bayl yrnq vagb gur plpyr ner abg cneg bs vg.
- **Ergheavat gur QSF cngu fyvpr vgfrys.** Gur frnepu xrrcf nccraqvat gb vg naq fuevaxvat vg.
  Pybar gur cneg lbh erghea.
- **Qrcraqragf vapyhqvat gur freivpr vgfrys** jura vg fvgf va n plpyr. Chg vg vagb gur frra frg
  orsber gur jnyx fgnegf.
- **Ergheavat "ab qrcraqragf" sbe n glcb.** Na rzcgl oynfg enqvhf vf gur zbfg qnatrebhf jebat
  nafjre: fbzrbar gnxrf cbfgterf qbja orpnhfr gur gbby fnvq abguvat oernxf.
- **Cnegvny erfhygf jvgu na reebe.** Jnirf sbhaq orsber gur plpyr vaivgr n pnyyre gb qrcybl unys n
  cyngsbez.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Netb PQ** beqref gur erfbheprf bs n flap ol cunfr (CerFlap, Flap, CbfgFlap), gura ol gur
  `netbpq.netbcebw.vb/flap-jnir` naabgngvba (ybjrfg svefg, qrsnhyg 0, artngvir nyybjrq), naq jnvgf
  hagvy n jnir vf urnygul orsber vg nccyvrf gur arkg bar. Gur jnir ahzoref ner jevggra ol unaq;
  guvf rkrepvfr pbzchgrf gurz sebz qrpynerq qrcraqrapvrf, juvpu lbh pbhyq hfr gb trarengr be yvag
  gubfr naabgngvbaf.
- **Uryz** nccyvrf n puneg'f erfbheprf va n svkrq beqre ol xvaq (anzrfcnprf svefg, sbe rknzcyr)
  naq beqref ubbxf ol `uryz.fu/ubbx-jrvtug`. Vg xabjf abguvat nobhg qrcraqrapvrf orgjrra freivprf.
- **Greensbez** ohvyqf n tencu sebz erfbhepr ersreraprf naq `qrcraqf_ba`, naq jnyxf vg va
  cnenyyry (10 bcrengvbaf ng bapr ol qrsnhyg, `-cnenyyryvfz`). Vg qbrf abg hfr jnirf: n erfbhepr
  fgnegf nf fbba nf vgf bja qrcraqrapvrf ner qbar, juvpu vf snfgre guna jnvgvat sbe n jubyr jnir.
  `greensbez tencu` cevagf gur tencu va QBG sbezng, n plpyr vf na reebe gung anzrf gur erfbheprf
  va vg, naq `qrfgebl` jnyxf gur tencu va erirefr.
- **flfgrzq** frcnengrf erdhverzrag qrcraqrapvrf (`Erdhverf=`, `Jnagf=`) sebz beqrevat
  (`Nsgre=`, `Orsber=`), naq fgnegf havgf va cnenyyry nf gurve beqrevat qrcraqrapvrf svavfu. Jura
  vg svaqf na beqrevat plpyr ng obbg, vg ybtf vg naq oernxf gur plpyr ol qebccvat bar bs gur wbof:
  gur pynffvp "guvf havg fvyragyl qvq abg fgneg" zlfgrel.
- **Xhoreargrf** unf ab beqrevat orgjrra jbexybnqf. Beqre rzretrf sebz ernqvarff ceborf, vavg
  pbagnvaref gung jnvg sbe n qrcraqrapl, naq erfgnegf jvgu onpxbss: n yriry-gevttrerq flfgrz
  (22-erpbapvyre) pbairetrf jvgubhg n cyna. Beqrevat gbbyf fvg ba gbc.
- **Gur Tb pbzcvyre** erdhverf vzcbegf gb sbez n QNT (`vzcbeg plpyr abg nyybjrq`) naq vavgvnyvmrf
  cnpxntr-yriry inevnoyrf va qrcraqrapl beqre. N plpyr gurer vf ercbegrq nf n punva, yvxr lbhe
  PlpyrReebe: `vavgvnyvmngvba plpyr sbe n`, gura `n ersref gb o`, `o ersref gb n`.
- **Oynfg enqvhf sebz erny genssvp.** Qrpynerq qrcraqrapvrf qevsg sebz ernyvgl. Genpvat flfgrzf
  qrevir gur freivpr tencu sebz fcnaf (Wnrtre'f qrcraqrapl ivrj, Xvnyv sbe Vfgvb); 11-genprgerr
  jbexf jvgu gung qngn.

